#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Socks"
msgstr "Socks"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "&Enable SOCKS support"
msgstr "Bol&ehkan sokongan SOCKS"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"Check this to enable SOCKS4 and SOCKS5 support in KDE applications and I/O "
"subsystems."
msgstr ""
"Pilih ini untuk bolehkan sokongan SOCKS4 dan SOCKS5 KDE di dalam aplikasi "
"KDE dan subsistem I/O."

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "SOCKS Implementation"
msgstr "Pelaksanaan SOCKS"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "A&uto detect"
msgstr "Kesan a&uto"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"If you select Autodetect, then KDE will automatically search for an "
"implementation of SOCKS on your computer."
msgstr ""
"Jika anda pilih kesan-auto, KDE akan memulakan carian automatik untuk "
"pelaksanaan SOCKS bagi komputer anda."

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "&NEC SOCKS"
msgstr "&NEC SOCKS"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "This will force KDE to use NEC SOCKS if it can be found."
msgstr "Ini akan memaksa KDE untuk menggunakan NEC SOCKS jika ditemui."

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Use &custom library"
msgstr "Guna pustaka sendi&ri"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid ""
"Select custom if you wish to use an unlisted SOCKS library. Please note that "
"this may not always work as it depends on the API of the library which you "
"specify (below)."
msgstr ""
"Pilih tersendiri jika anda mahu gunakan pustaka SOCKS yang tidak tersenarai. "
"Ambil perhatian yang ini tidak selalunya berfungsi, bergantung kepada "
"pustaka API yang anda tentukan (di bawah)."

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "&Path:"
msgstr "&Laluan:"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Enter the path to an unsupported SOCKS library."
msgstr "Masukkan laluan ke pustaka SOCKS tidak disokong."

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "&Dante"
msgstr "&Dante"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "This will force KDE to use Dante if it can be found."
msgstr "Ini akan memaksa menggunakan Dante KDE jika ditemui."

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Additional Library Search Paths"
msgstr "Laluan Tambahan Carian Pustaka"

#: rc.cpp:16
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Here you can specify additional directories to search for the SOCKS "
"libraries. /usr/lib, /usr/local/lib, /usr/local/socks5/lib and "
"/opt/socks5/lib are already searched by default."
msgstr "for dan."

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Path"
msgstr "Laluan"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "This is the list of additional paths that will be searched."
msgstr "Ini ialah senarai laluan tambahan yang akan dicari."

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "&Add"
msgstr "T&ambah"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "U&ji"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "Click here to test SOCKS support."
msgstr "Klik sini untuk uji sokongan SOCKS."

#: socks.cpp:88
msgid "These changes will only apply to newly started applications."
msgstr "Perubahan ini hanya akan terlaksana dengan aplikasi yang baru dimulakan."

#: socks.cpp:90 socks.cpp:123 socks.cpp:128
msgid "SOCKS Support"
msgstr "Sokongan SOCKS"

#: socks.cpp:122
msgid "Success! SOCKS was found and initialized."
msgstr "Berjaya, SOCKS ditemui dan dan dimulakan."

#: socks.cpp:127
msgid "SOCKS could not be loaded."
msgstr "SOCKS tidak dapat dimuatkan."

#: socks.cpp:266
msgid ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>This module allows you to configure KDE support for a SOCKS server or "
"proxy.</p>"
"<p>SOCKS is a protocol to traverse firewalls as described in <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>"
"If you have no idea what this is and if your system administrator doesn't "
"tell you to use it, leave it disabled.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>Modul ini membenarkan anda menyelaraskan sokongan KDE untuk pelayan atau "
"proksi SOCKS .</p>"
"<p>SOCKS ialah protokol untuk pagar api sebagaimana di dalam <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>Jika anda  tidak tahu mengenai hal ini dan pentadbir sistem anda tidak "
"memberitahu untuk gunakan, biarkan SOCKS dimatikan.</p>"

#: socks.cpp:277
msgid "kcmsocks"
msgstr "kcmsocks"

#: socks.cpp:277
msgid "KDE SOCKS Control Module"
msgstr "Modul Kawalan SOCKS KDE"

